msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:129
msgid "Select **Computed column** and enter a MoonScript or Lua expression."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:130
msgid "The formula is the body of a function `(self, space) -> <expression>`; in MoonScript `@field` accesses `self.field`. The value is recomputed on each read and is not stored."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:132
msgid "**Example: `nom_complet` in `auteurs`** — combine first name, particle and last name while handling nulls:"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:134 doc/en/get-started.md:144 doc/en/get-started.md:159 doc/en/reference.md:142 doc/en/reference.md:156 doc/en/reference.md:174 doc/en/reference.md:200
msgid "```moonscript"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:135 doc/en/reference.md:143
msgid "parts = {}"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:136 doc/en/reference.md:144
msgid "table.insert(parts, @prenom) if @prenom and @prenom != \"\""
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:137 doc/en/reference.md:145
msgid "table.insert(parts, @particule) if @particule and @particule != \"\""
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:138 doc/en/reference.md:146
msgid "table.insert(parts, @nom) if @nom and @nom != \"\""
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:139 doc/en/reference.md:147
msgid "table.concat(parts, \" \")"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:142
msgid "The `space` parameter gives access to records of another space (full scan):"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:145 doc/en/reference.md:175
msgid "-- Count available copies for this book"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:146 doc/en/reference.md:176
msgid "n = 0"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:147 doc/en/reference.md:177
msgid "for e in *space(\"exemplaires\")"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:148 doc/en/reference.md:178
msgid "  n += 1 if e.livre_id == @id and e.disponible"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:149 doc/en/reference.md:179
msgid "n"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:152
msgid "### Trigger formula ((trigger))"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:154
msgid "Select **Trigger formula** and optionally list the trigger fields."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/get-started.md:155
msgid "The formula is executed and the result **stored** on each creation or modification of the listed fields."
