#: doc/en/reference.md:695
msgid "## 7. Data Views (Saved Queries)"
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/reference.md:697
msgid "**Data Views** allow saving a specific configuration of a space (filtering, sorting, grouping, and column selection) as a reusable entity."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/reference.md:699
