msgstr ""

#: doc/en/reference.md:701
msgid "- **Filtering**: Persistent filter (MoonScript or UI-based) applied to the source space."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/reference.md:702
msgid "- **Grouping & Aggregation**: Server-side grouping (GROUP BY) and aggregations (COUNT, SUM, AVG, MIN, MAX)."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/reference.md:703
msgid "- **Column Mapping**: Custom selection and naming of output columns."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/reference.md:704
msgid "- **Ordering**: Default sort order."
msgstr ""

#: doc/en/reference.md:705
msgid "- **Widget Source**: Data Views can be used as sources for widgets in **Custom Views**, allowing dashboards to display pre-processed or aggregated data."
msgstr ""

